  "abstract": "Mean accuracy for RLRF exceeds 0.97 across the four simulated experiments, against 0.68 for the modeled RLHF baseline. This is the sweep\u2019s headline number and it is an output of parameters the sweep sets: the simulated parties are distributions whose per- party accuracy is an input to the run. It is not a measurement of any system.",
